  "plain": "The Apollo 11 crew are said to have been followed on their way to the Moon in 1969 and watched by craft once they landed, with Neil Armstrong reporting it on a private radio channel. Steve Colbern, a scientist who studies objects said to be alien implants in human bodies, repeats this to Michels from what he says unnamed NASA whistleblowers reported: \"he was on a private channel after landing on the moon.\" If true, it would mean the first Moon landing had company that NASA kept off the public broadcast."
